<BaseLayout title="Rituals" description="Small, generous ways to spend a day at MotionHotel."><section class="page"><p class="eyebrow">THE GOOD HOURS</p><h1>Rituals, not a schedule.</h1><p>Follow your appetite for sun, water and a little bit of nothing.</p></section><section class="section ritual-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE MOTIONHOTEL WAY</p><h2>Days shaped by<br><em>how they feel.</em></h2></div><p>There is no programme to keep up with here. Instead, we make room for the gentle rhythms of the island: the cool hour before breakfast, the long pause after lunch, the sea when it turns silver at dusk.</p></section><section class="ritual-split"><div class="ritual-image"><Image src={wellness} alt="Outdoor shower and plunge pool above the sea" widths={[640,960,1280]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 50vw" format="avif" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="ritual-panel"><p class="eyebrow">01 · FIRST LIGHT</p><h2>Begin in the water.</h2><p>Before the island wakes, the pool is glass-still. Swim a few slow lengths, step under the outdoor shower, then find your way to breakfast at your own pace.</p><ul><li>Sunrise pool access</li><li>Cold-water plunge ritual</li><li>Seasonal breakfast until 11:30</li></ul></div></section><section class="section ritual-listing"><p class="eyebrow">MAKE THE DAY YOURS</p><div class="ritual-items"><article><span>02</span><h2>The long table</h2><p>At golden hour, the kitchen sets out island vegetables, catch-of-the-day and wine from nearby vines. No dress code, only a seat saved for you.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h2>Walk the quiet side</h2><p>A local guide takes you along ancient footpaths, past whitewashed chapels and the coves the day-trippers never find.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h2>After the heat</h2><p>Book a slow body treatment with olive oil and warm stone, then linger somewhere cool with a book.</p></article></div></section><section class="experience-banner"><Image src={dinner} alt="Candlelit dinner on a terrace overlooking the Aegean" widths={[768,1200,1600]} sizes="100vw" format="avif" loading="lazy" /><div><p class="eyebrow">DINNER, UNRUSHED</p><h2>The best evenings<br><em>take their time.</em></h2><a class="btn" href="/contact">Plan your stay &#8599;</a></div></section><section class="section ritual-note"><Image src={breakfast} alt="Breakfast served by the sea" widths={[480,720,960]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 35vw" format="avif" loading="lazy" /><div><p class="eyebrow">A NOTE ON WELLBEING</p><h2>Nothing complicated. Just very good.</h2><p>Every ritual is optional, every hour your own. Ask us for a little guidance, or leave the whole day blank.</p><a class="small-link" href="/contact">Ask our hosts &#8599;</a></div></section></BaseLayout>
